\par\par \uc2 National Desk; SECTA\par \b \uc2 On  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2 , Harris Says It Is Trump To Blame\b0\par\par\uc2 By Nicholas Nehamas \par \uc2 781 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 April 2024\par \uc2 The New York Times\par \uc2 NYTF\par \uc2 Late Edition - Final\par 11\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2024 The New York Times Company.  All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 At a rally in Tucson, Ariz., days after the state's top court upheld a near-total ban on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Vice President \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  placed the blame directly on former President \uc2 Donald J. Trump\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Vice President \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  laid into former President \uc2 Donald J. Trump\uc2  over \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights at a campaign rally in Arizona on Friday, accusing him of being directly responsible for a court decision this week that upheld the state's 160-year-old near-total ban on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 ''Overturning Roe was just the opening act,'' Ms. Harris told a crowd of several dozen supporters at a community center in Tucson, Ariz. ''Just the opening act of a larger strategy to take women's rights and freedoms. Part of a full-on attack -- state by state -- on reproductive freedom. And we all must understand who is to blame: Former President \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  did this.''\par \par \uc2 Ms. Harris went on to call \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions in states like Arizona ''Trump's \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans.''\par \par \uc2 This week, the Arizona Supreme Court ruled that an 1864 law banning almost all abortions, without exceptions for rape or incest, could be enforced, although not right away. Doctors could face prosecution under the law, which dates to a time before Arizona became a state.\par \par \uc2 The court's decision came the day after Mr. Trump said that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  should be left to the states, underscoring the unfavorable political terrain for Republicans on the issue. As president, Mr. Trump appointed three of the Supreme Court justices who voted to overturn Roe v. Wade in 2022, which has led to a proliferation of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans across red states.\par \par \uc2 Democrats, led by Ms. Harris, have seized on the Arizona law. The Biden campaign released a new messaging campaign with the tagline: ''\uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  did this.'' \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights groups in Arizona have set up rallies around the state, which has a race for an open Senate seat this year that could determine control of the chamber.\par \par \uc2 ''This has been a very, very scary week for our state of Arizona,'' said Representative \uc2 Ruben Gallego\uc2 , a Democrat who is running for that Senate seat against Kari Lake, a Republican. ''Tuesday's decision rocked all of us. We now have the nation's most extreme \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban.''\par \par \uc2 Democratic candidates nationwide are focusing on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in their races, buoyed by the knowledge that the issue has propelled their party to a series of unexpected victories over the last two years. \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is one of the few issues on which President Biden polls better than Mr. Trump.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Trump has said he does not support the Arizona law, as well as other extreme restrictions such as a six-week ban in Florida. He has argued that supporting those bans is hurting Republicans at the ballot box. But his allies have made plans to use the federal government to limit \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  should they win the White House. In Tucson, Ms Harris referred to those plans, which \uc2 The New York Times\uc2  has reported would rely on enforcing the Comstock Act.\par \par \uc2 ''Here's what a second Trump term looks like,'' Ms. Harris said. ''More bans, more suffering and less freedom. Just like he did in Arizona, he basically wants to take America back to the 1800s.''\par \par \uc2 ''Shame!'' the crowd cried out as she described the potential impact of the 1864 law.\par \par \uc2 For Ms. Harris, the prominence of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the presidential race is a chance to expand her profile as vice president, as well as her presence on the campaign trail. Last month, she became the highest-ranking U.S. official known to visit an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinic.\par \par \uc2 ''\uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  has become the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  czar of the Biden administration,'' Carol Tobias, the president of the \uc2 National Right to Life Committee\uc2 , an anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  group, said in a statement. ''Instead of joining with the pro-life movement to build programs and safety nets to help promote real solutions for women and their preborn children, \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  and \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  have engaged in fear-mongering and propaganda.''\par \par \uc2 Ms. Harris may make for a more natural messenger on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  than Mr. Biden, an 81-year-old practicing Catholic who has long expressed personal discomfort with the procedure even as he has become a committed supporter of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights. He rarely uses the word ''\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 '' when speaking. On Friday, in contrast, Ms. Harris leaned into the issue.\par \par \uc2 In the United States, she argued, freedom includes the right ''to make decisions about one's own body and not have the government telling people what to do.''\par \par \uc2 Lisa Lerer contributed reporting.\par \par \uc2 Lisa Lerer contributed reporting.\par \par \uc2 This article appeared in print on page A11. \par \par \uc2 Document NYTF000020240413ek4d0004g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw284\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal4260\pichgoal600
